        "attribution": "Cirac and Zoller supplied influential proposals and theory; Blatt's experiments demonstrated and advanced the approach.",
        "maturity": "Trapped-ion control is reproducible and technically mature, although scaling to large fault-tolerant processors remains an active challenge.",
